      "content": "i get that but im really just looking for a way to optimize everything for this week. if i stay super hydrated and eat well, wouldn't that balance out the caffeine? like, is there a specific amount of caffeine that is actually \"safe\" to take with ritalin so i don't have to worry about it? i just want a concrete number so i can plan my study schedule.",
